                "text": "Today, I voted for H.R. 485, the Protecting Health Care for All Patients Act, to prevent qualified adjusted life years (QALYs) in federal healthcare. QALYs use factors like age, disability, or chronic illness to measure a person\u2019s worthiness of care. This is just wrong. https://t.co/lCyTfrRNby",
